### Obtener vehículos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles

### Crear vehículo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "BICICLETA",
  "brand": "Trek",
  "model": "Marlin 5",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "latitude": -12.0464,
  "longitude": -77.0428
}

### Obtener vehículo
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles/1